{"seq":1,"slug":"promise-fulfillment-and-cost-metrics","title":"履约达成率与赔付成本指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/promise-performance-cro/promise-fulfillment-and-cost-metrics","wordCount":3192,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"履约达成率与赔付成本指标体系\">履约达成率与赔付成本指标体系</h1><p>把承诺送达做上线之后，团队最常犯的第一个错是只盯一个数字：履约达成率。达成率 99% 听起来是优秀的成绩，但如果它是靠「一律承诺 14 天」换来的，那么转化率会被这个保守承诺吃掉，赔付成本只是被转移到了营收端——你省下的每一分赔付，都是从购物车里流失的订单。指标体系存在的意义，恰恰是阻止这种单点优化。承诺系统至少要在三个方向上同时被度量：<strong>承诺是否被兑现</strong>（达成率）、<strong>承诺是否说得准</strong>（准确率与偏差方向）、<strong>兑现失败花了多少钱</strong>（赔付成本与追偿回收）。三者的口径必须互相咬合，否则一个指标的改善会以另一个指标的恶化为代价而无人察觉。本文只谈度量层，承诺日如何算见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../delivery-promise-product/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺送达日期计算模型</a>，超时如何判定见 <a href=\"../lateness-determination/delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">妥投事件与超时判定口径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-达成率不能单独看-要配准确率与偏差方向\">核心概念：达成率不能单独看，要配准确率与偏差方向</h2><p>履约达成率（Promise Fulfillment Rate, PFR）的分母是被承诺保障、且已到可判定时点的订单，而不是全部订单：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PFR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>on-time</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>exempt</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PFR} = \\frac{N_{\\text{on-time}}}{N_{\\text{promise}} - N_{\\text{exempt}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PFR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exempt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on-time</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子只统计在承诺时刻或之前妥投的订单。这里立刻出现第一个口径分歧：提前妥投算不算达成？业务上算，但若把「提前」也当成好结果而不加区分，就会丢失一个有商业价值的信号。真正的质量分布是承诺误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = a_i - p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（实际妥投时刻减承诺时刻），它同时有<strong>偏差</strong>与<strong>离散度</strong>两个维度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bias</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>P95</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>percentile</mtext><mn>95</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bias} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(a_i - p_i), \\qquad \\text{P95}_{|\\Delta|} = \\text{percentile}_{95}(|\\Delta|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bias</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P95</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣Δ∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">percentile</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>偏差为负说明承诺整体偏保守（系统性地多留了缓冲），偏差为正说明承诺整体偏激进（迟早要赔付）。两个团队可以报告相同的 PFR，却处在完全不同的经营状态：A 团队偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天、P95 绝对误差 4 天，是把成本花在了过多的安全垫上；B 团队偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 天、P95 绝对误差 3 天，是贴近极限的高效承诺，代价是尾部订单会赔付。只看 PFR，这两者无法区分——这正是「达成率不能单独看」的工程含义。</p>\n<p>对于按窗口或星期粒度承诺的订单（如「3–5 天到」），达成率还要拆成<strong>窗口内妥投率</strong>与<strong>窗口命中位置</strong>。承诺为 3–5 天、实际 4 天到，是完美履约；实际 2 天到，虽然「没迟到」，但落点到了窗口之外，说明承诺的宽度设置失真。因此需要额外一个指标：落在承诺窗口内的比例，它的分母同样排除免责订单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量口径的三个陷阱-分母-时点与重算\">度量口径的三个陷阱：分母、时点与重算</h2><p>指标一旦上线，争议几乎全部来自口径而非计算。跨境场景放大了三类陷阱。</p>\n<p><strong>分母陷阱</strong>——哪些订单进分母。取消订单、买家主动改约、因未提供清关信息被扣关的订单属于<strong>免责集合</strong>，必须移出分母；但如果把它们悄无声息地塞进分子（当作「未超时」），达成率就会被系统性抬高。正确做法是让免责判定与赔付的免责子句共用同一套规则（见 <a href=\"../auto-compensation-carrier-claim/compensation-liability-model\">赔付规则与责任主体归属模型</a> 的免责集合），保证「不算赔付」与「不算失败」是同一件事。</p>\n<p><strong>时点陷阱</strong>——什么时候可以定论。跨境包裹的妥投证据常常滞后数天，若在订单「到点」当天就把它计入未达成，会有大量订单在证据补录后被追认为准时，账面上制造虚假的超时。工程上必须设一个<strong>成熟窗口（maturity window）</strong>，即承诺时刻之后再等待足够长的时间（覆盖尾程扫描的典型延迟）才把订单锁进不可变的结果集。成熟窗口之前的订单应放进「待定」桶，不进分子也不进分母，否则每日指标会剧烈震荡。</p>\n<p><strong>重算陷阱</strong>——规则版本变了，历史指标怎么办。承诺规则、免责清单、判定口径都会随时间演进。若用今日规则重算三个月前的订单，历史达成率会在每次规则更新后跳变，管理层无法判断到底是运营变好了还是口径变松了。解法是把每个订单的承诺快照、规则版本 ID 与判定结果一起冻结，指标计算时回放当时的版本——这与承诺日必须逐单可复现是同一条原则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>错误做法</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分母</td>\n<td>免责订单计入分子</td>\n<td>达成率虚高，赔付额对不上</td>\n<td>免责集与赔付免责子句共用规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时点</td>\n<td>到点即判未达成</td>\n<td>每日指标震荡、虚假超时</td>\n<td>设成熟窗口，待定单不入分子分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重算</td>\n<td>用现行规则重算历史</td>\n<td>指标跳变、无法归因</td>\n<td>冻结承诺快照与规则版本，回放计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;订单事件流&lt;br/&gt;下单/发货/扫描/妥投&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;承诺快照&lt;br/&gt;承诺时刻 + 规则版本&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;妥投证据&lt;br/&gt;签收影像/投递扫描&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D{&quot;成熟窗口已过?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[&quot;待定桶&lt;br/&gt;不进分子分母&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{&quot;命中免责集合?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;免责桶&lt;br/&gt;移出分母&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;结果集&lt;br/&gt;准时 / 超时&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;达标率层&lt;br/&gt;PFR / 偏差 / P95&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; J[&quot;赔付层&lt;br/&gt;赔付率 / 单均赔付&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;成本层&lt;br/&gt;净赔付成本 / 追偿回收率&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; L[&quot;联合判据&lt;br/&gt;净成本 vs 转化&quot;]&#10;    K --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"订单事件流&lt;br/&gt;下单/发货/扫描/妥投\"] --&gt; B[\"承诺快照&lt;br/&gt;承诺时刻 + 规则版本\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"妥投证据&lt;br/&gt;签收影像/投递扫描\"]\n    B --&gt; D{\"成熟窗口已过?\"}\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt;|否| E[\"待定桶&lt;br/&gt;不进分子分母\"]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{\"命中免责集合?\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"免责桶&lt;br/&gt;移出分母\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"结果集&lt;br/&gt;准时 / 超时\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"达标率层&lt;br/&gt;PFR / 偏差 / P95\"]\n    H --&gt; J[\"赔付层&lt;br/&gt;赔付率 / 单均赔付\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"成本层&lt;br/&gt;净赔付成本 / 追偿回收率\"]\n    I --&gt; L[\"联合判据&lt;br/&gt;净成本 vs 转化\"]\n    K --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"赔付成本的四层结构\">赔付成本的四层结构</h2><p>达成率回答「兑现得怎么样」，赔付成本回答「没兑现花了多少钱」。后者不能记成一个数，否则亏损无法归因。它至少有四层，每层回答不同的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：赔付率</strong>，即保障订单中最终产生赔付的比例。它与超时率并不相等——超时是判定结果，赔付还要过证据、免责、反欺诈几道闸门，所以赔付率通常低于超时率，两者的差额本身就是「闸门有效性」的度量。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：单均赔付额</strong>，即每笔赔付的实际金额。它由赔付形式决定：全额退运费、固定抵扣券、按货值比例赔付，形态不同则单均金额的尺度完全不同。这一层必须按赔付形式分桶统计，混在一起求平均会得到一个没有意义的数字。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：净赔付成本</strong>。这是唯一能进损益表的数字：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NetCost</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>payout</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>赔付支出</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>carrier</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>承运商追偿</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>卖家扣款</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetCost} = \\underbrace{C_{\\text{payout}}}_{\\text{赔付支出}} - \\underbrace{R_{\\text{carrier}}}_{\\text{承运商追偿}} - \\underbrace{R_{\\text{seller}}}_{\\text{卖家扣款}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetCost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">赔付支出</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">承运商追偿</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">carrier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">卖家扣款</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三项分别记在不同的账上，任何一项缺失都让净成本失真。</p>\n<p><strong>第四层：追偿回收率</strong>，即从承运商处实际收回的金额占赔付支出的比例。它是最容易被忽略、却最受外部规则约束的一层。承运商索赔有硬性时限与上限，错过时限即归零：eBay 的交易保障要求买家在预计送达日之后 <strong>30 个日历日</strong>内提出，卖家须在 <strong>3 个工作日</strong>内回应（ebay.com 帮助中心）；美国联邦贸易委员会的邮购规则（16 CFR 435）规定，未标注发货时间时默认须在下单后 <strong>30 天</strong>内发货，延迟须主动通知买家并提供取消与退款选项，退款须在 <strong>7 个工作日</strong>内发出（ftc.gov 商业指南）。因此系统必须在订单上记录<strong>承运商索赔截止日</strong>这一字段，并在接近截止时提前告警，把「能要回来的钱」和「要晚了就要不回来」区分开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>口径要点</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>赔付率</td>\n<td>赔付订单 / 保障订单</td>\n<td>与超时率分开，差额即闸门有效性</td>\n<td>度量闸门是否过松或过紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单均赔付额</td>\n<td>赔付支出 / 赔付订单</td>\n<td>必须按赔付形式分桶</td>\n<td>定价与赔付形式选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净赔付成本</td>\n<td>赔付 − 追偿 − 卖家扣款</td>\n<td>三本账分开记</td>\n<td>唯一可进损益表的数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追偿回收率</td>\n<td>追偿回收 / 赔付支出</td>\n<td>受索赔时限与上限硬约束</td>\n<td>承运合同谈判与时效管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标之间的张力-用净成本与转化做联合判据\">指标之间的张力：用净成本与转化做联合判据</h2><p>把上面两组合起来，承诺系统的真实目标函数浮现出来：不是最大化达成率，也不是最小化赔付成本，而是<strong>最小化「承诺保守化的转化损失 + 净赔付成本」之和</strong>。承诺越保守，赔付越少但转化越低；承诺越激进，转化越高但赔付越多。这是一个典型的带拐点优化，最优解在边际相等处：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>conv</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>多留一天缓冲的转化损失</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext>NetCost</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>多留一天缓冲省下的赔付</mtext></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underbrace{\\frac{\\partial C_{\\text{conv}}}{\\partial \\text{buffer}}}_{\\text{多留一天缓冲的转化损失}} + \\underbrace{\\frac{\\partial \\text{NetCost}}{\\partial \\text{buffer}}}_{\\text{多留一天缓冲省下的赔付}} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3838em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3591em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">多留一天缓冲的转化损失</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0374em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">conv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3838em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3591em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">多留一天缓冲省下的赔付</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0374em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetCost</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的工程价值在于它把「承诺留几天缓冲」从一个拍脑袋的产品决定，变成一个有度量依据的决策。要让它在实践中可用，需要两个前提：一是转化率对承诺时长的弹性可被测量（通常来自 AB 实验），二是净赔付成本对缓冲的弹性可被估算（来自历史赔付数据的分位数外推）。没有这两个弹性数据，公式只是装饰；有了它们，团队可以在每次调整承诺策略前先算出预期净收益。</p>\n<p>受监管约束的下界同样要进模型。欧盟消费者权利指令 2011/83/EU 第 18 条规定，未约定交付时间时，经营者须「不迟于合同订立后 <strong>30 天</strong>」交付；第 20 条规定风险在消费者实际取得占有时转移，除消费者自行委托承运人且经营者未提供该选项的情形外（EUR-Lex / legislation.gov.uk）。美国的默认 30 天发货规则亦同。这些法定下限意味着承诺缓冲不能无限压缩——合法合规是承诺时长的硬地板，优化只能在它之上进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从埋点到仪表盘-指标如何被算出来\">从埋点到仪表盘：指标如何被算出来</h2><p>指标的可信度取决于埋点，而不是取决于 BI 工具。要让上述每个指标可复现，订单上必须至少冻结四类字段：<strong>承诺快照</strong>（承诺时刻、承诺窗口、承诺粒度、规则版本 ID）、<strong>证据等级</strong>（哪一级扫描事件构成妥投）、<strong>免责与闸门判定结果</strong>、<strong>承运商索赔截止日</strong>。缺任何一个，对应指标就只能靠事后推断，而推断值无法用于赔付结算，也无法用于监管审计。</p>\n<p>仪表盘的组织方式应遵循「一层一屏、逐层下钻」：第一屏是达成率层（PFR、偏差、P95 绝对误差、窗口命中率），第二屏是赔付层（赔付率、单均赔付额，按形式与国别分桶），第三屏是成本层（净赔付成本、追偿回收率、索赔超期率）。三屏之间用同一套订单 ID 贯通，任何一屏上看到的异常都能下钻到具体订单，而不是停在聚合数字上互相对不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这套指标体系的核心主张只有一句：<strong>承诺系统不能被任何单一数字优化</strong>。履约达成率必须与承诺偏差、P95 绝对误差、窗口命中率一起读，才能区分「保守承诺换来的高达成」与「贴近极限的高效承诺」；赔付成本必须拆成赔付率、单均赔付额、净赔付成本、追偿回收率四层，才能知道亏损出在哪一环；而两组合起来，真正的目标函数是「承诺保守化的转化损失 + 净赔付成本」之和，最优缓冲在边际相等处，且被法定下限硬性约束。</p>\n<p>落地时的最小要求是四件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在订单上冻结承诺快照、规则版本 ID、证据等级与承运商索赔截止日四类字段，让每个指标都能逐单复现；</li>\n<li>用免责集合统一「不算失败」与「不算赔付」的口径，并设成熟窗口隔离待定订单；</li>\n<li>按「达成率层 → 赔付层 → 成本层」组织仪表盘，三层用同一订单 ID 贯通，可逐层下钻；</li>\n<li>按责任主体分层设置预警阈值，让指标所有权与赔付责任归属对齐。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>做到这些，承诺系统才从一个「会赔钱的营销话术」变成一套可度量、可归因、可优化的经营机制。承诺日的计算方法见 <a href=\"../delivery-promise-product/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺送达日期计算模型</a>，超时判定口径见 <a href=\"../lateness-determination/delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">妥投事件与超时判定口径</a>，赔付与追偿的建模见 <a href=\"../auto-compensation-carrier-claim/compensation-liability-model\">赔付规则与责任主体归属模型</a>。相关的时间异常事件处理见 <a href=\"../lateness-determination/promise-clock-exception-events\">承诺时钟与异常事件</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"履约达成率与赔付成本指标体系","id":"履约达成率与赔付成本指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：达成率不能单独看，要配准确率与偏差方向","id":"核心概念-达成率不能单独看-要配准确率与偏差方向"},{"level":2,"text":"度量口径的三个陷阱：分母、时点与重算","id":"度量口径的三个陷阱-分母-时点与重算"},{"level":2,"text":"赔付成本的四层结构","id":"赔付成本的四层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"指标之间的张力：用净成本与转化做联合判据","id":"指标之间的张力-用净成本与转化做联合判据"},{"level":2,"text":"从埋点到仪表盘：指标如何被算出来","id":"从埋点到仪表盘-指标如何被算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承运商追偿与索赔申诉实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/auto-compensation-carrier-claim/carrier-claim-and-recovery"},"next":{"title":"承诺准确度回归与灰度实验机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/promise-performance-cro/promise-accuracy-regression-experiment"}}